            "text": "In `Core::swap_6269342730()`, when the current `sqrtRatio` equals the `sqrtRatioLimit`, the swap is treated as a no-op, and the entire swap block is skipped. This includes the critical `_updatePairDebtWithNative()` call, which means ETH sent via `msg.value` is never accounted for in the debt system. The ETH becomes permanently stuck in the Core contract with no recovery mechanism."
